25
00:01:56.534 --> 00:02:01.764
what we provide: electronic and vibrational
information connected to a quantitative

26
00:02:01.794 --> 00:02:02.828
coupling result.

27
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:08.964
Our goal is to give materials researchers
high-fidelity, material-specific

28
00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:14.159
electron-phonon data they can use to
evaluate promising candidates. The
scientific

29
00:02:14.189 --> 00:02:18.853
